shots/
# candidates/* not candidates/ — git refuses to re-include a file whose parent
# directory is excluded by a directory pattern, so the negation below is dead
# unless the contents are what's excluded.
candidates/*
# The manifest saying which captured frame was promoted IS tracked. Four lines of
# JSON, and the only record of why assets/previews/ looks the way it does; without
# it a future session has to re-choose all seven from scratch.
!candidates/chosen.json
package-lock.json
